# 9. Trade-offs & Alternative Approaches

## Method 1 (Recommended)

```python
for i in range(1,n+1):
    print(i,end="")
```

Advantages

* Easy to understand.
* Uses constant memory.
* Beginner friendly.

---

## Method 2

```python
print(*range(1,n+1),sep="")
```

Advantages

* Short.
* Elegant.

Disadvantages

* Uses unpacking (`*`), which beginners may not know.

---

## Method 3

```python
print("".join(str(i) for i in range(1,n+1)))
```

Advantages

* Efficient for building strings.

Disadvantages

* Violates the problem constraint.

